OL,3,GNEWSAFurther arrests after shots fired
OL,4,Aat house
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree more people have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter shots were fired at a house in
OL,8,Fthe village of Heather.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Ravenstone Road
OL,11,Fjust after 22:00 BST on Wednesday after
OL,12,Fdamage was caused to the window of a
OL,13,Fhouse and a car parked outside the
OL,14,Fproperty.
OL,16,FLeicestershire Police said three men,
OL,17,F25, 29 and 36, were arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of possession of a firearm
OL,19,Fwith intent to cause fear of violence
OL,20,Fon Monday and remained in custody.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
